// Tags: attack.stealth
// Description: Identifies when a owner is was removed from a application or service principal in Azure.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where ((operationName == "Remove owner from service principal" or operationName == "Remove owner from application"))
